{"headword":"יֶ֫לֶד","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:8\" href=\"/Genesis.21.8\">Gn 21:8</a> child, son, boy, youth—<span dir=\"rtl\">יֶ֫לֶד</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 4:23\" href=\"/Genesis.4.23\">Gn 4:23</a> +; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 31:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.31.20\">Je 31:20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֑לֶד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:16\" href=\"/Genesis.21.16\">Gn 21:16</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלָדִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:1\" href=\"/Genesis.33.1\">33:1</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">יַלְדֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:6\" href=\"/Exodus.2.6\">Ex 2:6</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">יִלְדֵי־</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 57:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.57.4\">Is 57:4</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְלָדַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:26\" href=\"/Genesis.30.26\">Gn 30:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 4:1\" href=\"/II_Kings.4.1\">2 K 4:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַלְדֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 21:11\" href=\"/Job.21.11\">Jb 21:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יַלְדֵיהֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:2\" href=\"/Genesis.33.2\">Gn 33:2</a> + 4 times, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>child</em> = <em>son, boy</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:8\" href=\"/Genesis.21.8\">Gn 21:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:14\" href=\"/Genesis.21.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:15\" href=\"/Genesis.21.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:16\" href=\"/Genesis.21.16\">16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:30\" href=\"/Genesis.37.30\">37:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:22\" href=\"/Genesis.42.22\">42:22</a> (all E), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:23\" href=\"/Genesis.32.23\">32:23</a> (Dinah not included), cf. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:26\" href=\"/Genesis.30.26\">30:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:1\" href=\"/Genesis.33.1\">33:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:2\" href=\"/Genesis.42.2\">2</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 42:5\" href=\"/Genesis.42.5\">5</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-